    description: "Found by the 2026-11-07 docstring staleness audit (dev 4f2feb451b): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_11072026/review, verify and blind). Corpus impact not measured. _get_enclosing_function_php (php.py:476) finds the owner with _get_enclosing_class, which matches class_declaration only (php.py:280). Fixture: trait T::a and enum E2::m each give `calls a.php -> helper` and no T.a -> T.b or E2.m -> E2.n; a class method in the same file gets its edges. r16, v06."  # d2c0
