- op: discuss  # 04bc
  at: '2026-11-09T01:44:11Z'  # 04bc
  by: agent  # 04bc
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 04bc
  clock: 3  # 04bc
  nonce: 04bc  # 04bc
  message: "Fixed in PR #2092. php.py: the class-only _get_enclosing_class is gone; all four call sites use _enclosing_type_name, which covers traits and enums. Live repro on dev: trait Greets { greet() calls $this->name() } and enum Suit { label() calls $this->color() } -> calls edges Greets.greet -> Greets.name and Suit.label -> Suit.color (no edges before). Tests: TestPhpTraitAndEnumCallers. The PR's first CI round failed per-package coverage (php.py:1179 covered only cross-package); a direct test in test_php.py fixed it."  # 04bc
